      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nemail_password_login.py - signs in a user with email and password and returns tokens\nidentity_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Email/Password Account Lifecycle\nidentity_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Email/Password Account Lifecycle\nonboarding_summary.py - Summarize onboarding state for support\npassword_reset.py - starts a password reset flow for a local account\nprofile_moderation.py - Moderate profile text before account activation\nprofile_note_store.py - Persist onboarding notes and support metadata in a managed document store\nrefresh_session.py - refreshes an expired session or access token\nregister_user.py - creates a new email/password user account\nwelcome_translate.py - Translate onboarding copy into the user's locale\n\nCreate register_user.py in the current working directory.\nTask: creates a new email/password user account.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
